              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-KATA-NPC02-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Nice work, Wizard. Now there should be some way we can reanimate these and get a closer look at one of these golems...",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Mellori_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Mellori_POL_53.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1370024,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-KATA-NPC04_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Step aside, young lady. I'm the Science Specialist here. It's better if I examine these Cores. Hmm. I don't see how this functions.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Seal_Soldier_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SpecialistFrost_POL_01.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1370013,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-KATA-NPC02-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "That's because it's magic, not science, fish-brain. How about YOU step aside? I have an idea...",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Mellori_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Mellori_POL_54.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1370024,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-KATA-NPC02-B_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Hmm. I thought maybe the Crystals were powering the golem, but instead, it looks like the Crystals allow it to be controlled remotely.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_Mellori_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Mellori_POL_55.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1370024,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Voice of Rasputin",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS> Congratulations, little Witch. It seems you figured it out. But this work is crude. I have far more impressive creations to show you. </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Titan_Small_A_MOB.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Rasputin_POL_10.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "",
                "m_nameOverride": "Voice of Rasputin",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "<ITALICS> If you'll enter my vault, I'll show you one of my favorites, a tribute to Ivan in fact. Come see, Ivan, or are you scared? </ITALICS>",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Titan_Small_A_MOB.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Rasputin_POL_11.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 0,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-KATA-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ivan the Great is scared of nothing! Come, Wizard, let us enter this vault. If Rat has set trap, let us spring it.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Bear_Strongman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IvanTheGreat_POL_81.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1370011,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
