                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Sky Anchor? I don't know what that is. If it is valuable, though, it is in the Deep Vault. That's where he keeps all his favorite things.",
