                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Years ago, I sought to find the source of the Northern Lights and I discovered the Sky Anchor, a towering mountain of pure Borealis.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_Dockworker_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/CaptainJockCoosto_POL_03.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1371073,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-KATA-NPC07_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "I kept it secret, but Rasputin pried the Sky Anchor's location from my mind. Now, he will destroy the Anchor, and the Spiral along with it.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Penguin_Dockworker_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/CaptainJockCoosto_POL_04.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1371073,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "PL-WAL-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "If Sky Anchor is mountain, then what was big Gemstone Ivan loaded onto ship? We should go back and tell Mellori about this. This could be problem.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Bear_Strongman_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/IvanTheGreat_POL_88.mp3",
